WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.766
Danny: Help!

2
00:00:04.767 --> 00:00:08.925
Tina: I’ve got you! Don’t let go!

3
00:00:08.926 --> 00:00:13.164
Brad: Trust me. I will hold on tight.

4
00:00:13.165 --> 00:00:14.672
Tina: All right, guys.

5
00:00:14.673 --> 00:00:19.293
I’m going to pull you up.

6
00:00:19.294 --> 00:00:21.876
Brad: It’s not working.

7
00:00:21.877 --> 00:00:24.012
Tina: You’re too heavy.

8
00:00:24.013 --> 00:00:26.627
Danny: Try again.

9
00:00:26.628 --> 00:00:31.674
Tina: I’m going to try something different.

10
00:00:31.675 --> 00:00:34.276
Brad: Are you sure this is safe?

11
00:00:34.277 --> 00:00:42.786
Danny: Just hang on tight, Brad.

12
00:00:42.787 --> 00:00:45.424
Brad: That was really scary.

13
00:00:45.425 --> 00:00:47.607
Tina: You’re okay now, Brad.

14
00:00:47.608 --> 00:00:51.203
Danny: Thanks, Tina. You saved us.

15
00:00:51.204 --> 00:00:56.721
Tina: Well, I told you we would make it to the

16
00:00:56.722 --> 00:01:01.731
top. Danny: Let’s keep

17
00:01:01.732 --> 00:01:04.284
going. Tina: This isn’t

18
00:01:04.285 --> 00:01:09.186
good. Brad: I don’t like this

19
00:01:09.187 --> 00:01:15.992
mountain. Danny: Watch

20
00:01:15.993 --> 00:01:21.098
out! Brad: Did I mention that I don’t like this

21
00:01:21.099 --> 00:01:23.639
mountain? Danny: It’s too big to climb

22
00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:26.585
over. Tina: What if you made a ladder out of the

23
00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:29.270
clay? Brad: Or you could make

24
00:01:29.271 --> 00:01:32.424
ropes. Danny: I don’t have enough magic clay for

25
00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:34.538
that. Tina: How much do you have

26
00:01:34.539 --> 00:01:41.007
left? Danny: Not much. I have a few tiny pieces of red clay and one lump of yellow

27
00:01:41.008 --> 00:01:46.951
clay. But I need to save it if we’re going to defeat Tristay.

28
00:01:46.952 --> 00:01:50.005
Tina: The red clay looks like little seeds.

29
00:01:50.006 --> 00:01:52.240
Brad: That gives me an idea.

30
00:01:52.241 --> 00:01:55.536
If you made some seeds, we could plant them.

31
00:01:55.537 --> 00:01:59.795
Then maybe a vine would grow to the top of the mountain. Danny:

32
00:01:59.797 --> 00:02:26.814
Good idea! We could climb up, just like in "Jack and the Beanstalk."

33
00:02:26.815 --> 00:02:30.138
Tina: That’s so pretty!

34
00:02:30.139 --> 00:02:31.738
Brad: And it looks safe!

35
00:02:31.739 --> 00:02:39.950
We’ll have no problem now.

36
00:02:39.951 --> 00:02:43.294
Danny: Wow! We’re really high!

37
00:02:43.295 --> 00:02:51.908
Brad: We’re almost there.

38
00:02:51.909 --> 00:02:55.628
Danny: Quick, we’ve got to rescue Hopian and Bello.

39
00:02:55.629 --> 00:02:58.741
Tina: Keep an eye open for Tristay.

40
00:02:58.742 --> 00:03:03.572
Brad: And watch out for those evil creatures.

41
00:03:03.573 --> 00:03:09.457
Danny: It doesn’t look as if anyone is here.

42
00:03:09.458 --> 00:03:13.500
Brad: Look!

43
00:03:13.501 --> 00:03:15.426
Danny: Oh no!

44
00:03:15.427 --> 00:03:19.282
Tina: We’re too late!

